{
  "project": {
    "name": "Bottle-Thread Cap & Coupler",
    "slug": "bottle-thread",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "cadquery",
    "description": {
      "en": "Turns any discarded PET bottle into infrastructure. Generates screw caps, bottle-to-bottle couplers, and spout adapters whose real single-start helical thread mates with standard bottle-neck finishes (PCO-1881, PCO-1810, 28-410, 38-400). The input side of the Faircap water-filter ecosystem — water sovereignty from plastic waste.\n\nOfficial Visualizer and Configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Convierte cualquier botella PET desechada en infraestructura. Genera tapas roscadas, acopladores botella-a-botella y adaptadores de boquilla cuya rosca helicoidal real de un solo inicio encaja con acabados de cuello de botella estándar (PCO-1881, PCO-1810, 28-410, 38-400). El lado de entrada del ecosistema de filtros de agua Faircap — soberanía del agua a partir de residuos plásticos.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/bottle-thread.webp",
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "tags": [
      "bottle",
      "thread",
